  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The mortal killer move harboring malicious heart fills a Gu Immortal’s heart with wisdom path dao marks so blood essence can generate malicious wills more efficiently.",
      "chapters": [
        743
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Dong Fang Chang Fan’s body naturally holds wisdom path dao marks; each use of myriad star fireflies consumes at least sixteen of them, and once expended they are not recovered by ordinary means.",
      "chapters": [
        819
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_dong_fang_chang_fan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Those same marks amplify star thought Immortal Gu for wisdom path inheritors, just as Fang Yuan’s strength path dao marks amplify giant hand. Without wisdom path dao marks of his own, Fang Yuan cannot use myriad star fireflies unless he enters wisdom path.",
      "chapters": [
        820
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_star_thought_immortal_gu",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "General dao marks and attainment levels are covered on dao marks and attainment.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_dao_marks"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After taking the sovereign immortal fetus Gu body, Fang Yuan’s thoughts form rapidly and in large numbers, enough to sustain heavy consumption under the light of wisdom. He concludes the body must hold quite a lot of wisdom path dao marks, so he no longer needs wisdom path Gu worms only to replenish thoughts.",
      "chapters": [
        1025
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "living-body-thoughts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_sovereign_immortal_fetus_gu",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Purple Mountain True Monarch is a wisdom path Gu Immortal with deep wisdom path dao mark accumulation. When Fang Yuan tries to crush him in one fist, the marks make him as slippery as an eel, and he squeezes free.",
      "chapters": [
        1282
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "deep-mark-accumulation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Enchantment emotion path never left wisdom path. There are no enchantment emotion path dao marks in this world, only wisdom path dao marks, so clearing Zhang Li’s enchantment emotion dream raises Fang Yuan’s wisdom path attainment.",
      "chapters": [
        1340
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
